Files in this repository have been substantially modified from the originals, as
required by section 4(b) of the Apache License. The nature of the modification:

  * Everything other than the autocomplete engine was removed -- the chat and
    agent product, the React webview UI, codebase indexing and embeddings, the
    JetBrains and CLI front-ends, MCP, tools, slash commands, rules, Next Edit,
    the configuration system (config.yaml / the Continue hub / control plane),
    and all telemetry and analytics.
  * `core/autocomplete/**` is kept close to upstream so fixes remain
    cherry-pickable, with two deliberate seams: `CompletionProvider` takes an
    `AutocompleteConfigProvider` rather than Continue's `ConfigHandler`, and
    Next Edit is gone from the VS Code inline completion provider.
  * The completion cache was rewritten as in-memory, dropping the sqlite3
    dependency.
  * `packages/fetch`, `packages/llm-info` and `packages/openai-adapters` are
    vendored copies of the upstream packages of the same names, renamed to the
    `@fim/*` scope and modified. `packages/config-types` was removed and the one
    type this fork used from it was inlined into `packages/fetch`.
  * Product identity (name, settings namespace, command ids, outbound
    client-identification HTTP headers) was changed throughout.

